---
description: Validation and documentation requirements
globs: ["src/**/*.py", "scripts/**/*.py", "docs/**/*.md"]
---

Unit tests alone are not sufficient for runtime pipeline changes.

If a change affects:
- telemetry mapping
- segmentation
- samples.csv
- regime_variables.csv
- regime_variables_model.csv
- feature.csv
- Stage A / Stage B outputs
- validation artifacts
- hardware lifecycle timing
- runtime collection phases

require:
- real-run or real-artifact validation
- output inspection
- contract validation
- documentation update if behavior changed

Do not consider the task complete until:
- relevant validation passes
- required outputs exist
- docs are aligned

